# New additions are limited to the current lecture deliverables.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/理论力学讲义-合并版.pdf
!/第一章-完善版讲义/
!/第二章-完善版讲义/
!/第三章-完善版讲义/
!/第四章-完善版讲义/
!/第五章-完善版讲义/

# Keep editable figures and image inputs needed by the five main TeX files.
/*章-完善版讲义/*
!/*章-完善版讲义/*讲义-完善版.pdf
!/*章-完善版讲义/*讲义-完善版.tex
!/*章-完善版讲义/原图/
!/*章-完善版讲义/补充图/
!/*章-完善版讲义/题图/
!/*章-完善版讲义/解答图/

# Generated archives, previews, compiler files, and caches stay local.
*.zip
*.rar
*.aux
*.log
*.toc
*.out
*.xdv
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Authoring tools and audit records remain local for future updates.
**/工作文件/
**/*备份*/
**/资料核查/
